    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U05-L03-ACTIVITY-002",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: New Hours for the Kitchen",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Remember the bakery with the thermostat set to \\(65^\\circ \\text{F}\\)? At 5:00 a.m., the temperature in the kitchen rises to \\(85^\\circ \\text{F}\\) due to the ovens and other kitchen equipment being used until they are turned off at 10:00…",
