    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U05-L03-ACTIVITY-003",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: New Hours for the Kitchen",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Andre thinks, “When the bakery starts baking 2 hours earlier, that means I need to subtract 2 from \\(x\\) and that \\(G(x)=H(x-2)\\).” How could you help Andre understand the error in his thinking?",
