    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U05-L03-ACTIVITY-004",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: New Hours for the Kitchen",
      "SourceExcerpt": "The graph of \\(F\\) shows the temperatures after a change to the thermostat settings. What did the owner do?",
