      "SourceSection": "3.2: New Hours for the Kitchen",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Write an expression for \\(F\\) in terms of the original baking schedule, \\(H\\).",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u05-l03.rich-lesson-v2.json",
