    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U05-L03-ACTIVITY-014",
      "SourceSection": "3.3: Thawing Meat",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Remember the pumpkin catapult? The function \\(h\\) gives the height \\(h(t)\\), in feet, of the pumpkin above the ground \\(t\\) seconds after launch. Now suppose \\(k\\) represents the height \\(k(t)\\), in feet, of the pumpkin if it were launched…",
