    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U05-L03-ACTIVITY-015",
      "SourceSection": "3.3: Thawing Meat",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Since we know the pumpkin's height \\(k(t)\\) at time \\(t\\) is the same as the height \\(h(t)\\) of the original pumpkin at time \\(t-5\\), we can write \\(k\\) in terms of \\(h\\) as \\(k(t)=h(t-5)\\).",
